#! mathcas 2 notebook

#% title
# chessboard_distance

#% text
# `chessboard_distance(u, v)` gives the Chebyshev distance of the vectors u and v, the largest of the |u_i - v_i|.

#% section
# Examples

#% subsection
# Basic examples

#% cell
chessboard_distance([1, 5, 2], [4, 1, 0])
#% output
#= 4

#% cell
chessboard_distance([1.5, 0.6], [0, 0])
#% output
#= 1.5

#% cell
chessboard_distance(3, -2)
#% output
#= 5

#% section
# See also

#% text
# `manhattan_distance`, `euclidean_distance`
